      "content": "Living like that is exhausting, and it makes perfect sense that you just want the noise to stop. That feeling of being stuck while the world rushes past is a terrible kind of loneliness. If the world is moving on without you, maybe the most immediate relief is finding a way to make the *internal* noise quiet down for a little while. Reaching out to a professional can give you a safe space where you don't have to pretend to be anything but exactly how you feel right now.",
